  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "comment": "Lactococcus lactis strains were grown at 30°C in M17 medium (Oxoid Ltd., Hampshire, England) supplemented with 0.5% (wt/vol) glucose (GM17) or glucose streptococcal broth medium, a modified version of lactose streptococcal broth that contains glucose instead of lactose (PMID: 8031083)."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "Sterilize by autoclaving at 121°C for 15 minutes. Cool to 50°C and aseptically add 50ml of sterile lactose solution (10% w/v)."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "comment": "Sterilise by autoclaving at 121°C for 15 minutes or by membrane filtration through a 0.2mm membrane."
    }
  ]
}